all</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Benham</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Pangalos</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>mRNA distribution analysis of human TRPC family in CNS and peripheral tissues.</article-title><source>Brain Res Mol Brain Res</source><volume>109</volume><fpage>95</fpage><lpage>104</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12531519</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000573-Martorana1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Martorana</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Giampa</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>DeMarch</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Viscomi</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Patassini</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sancesario</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernardi</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Fusco</surname><given-names>FR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Distribution of TRPC1 receptors in dendrites of rat substantia nigra: a confocal and electron microscopy study.</article-title><source>Eur J Neurosci</source><volume>24</volume><fpage>732</fpage><lpage>738</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16930403</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000573-vonBohlen1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>vonBohlen</surname><given-names>UH</given-names></name></person-group><collab>HUUKEA</collab><year>2005</year><article-title>Distribution of TRPC1 and TRPC5 in medial temporal lobe structures in mice.</article-title><source>Cell Tissue Research</source><fpage>201</fpage><lpage>206</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000573-Chung1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal">